{"title":"Ornot Alpha Wool Pullover","link":"https://theradavist.com/ornot-alpha-wool-pullover","date":1793278834000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/98f33d7ab787be379a02eaebe2337121fb69b4db072673370cbe45ed400d8bd2.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/4aa81690464bfc2f6c7acdaf5bf3c8b316d20080529a9e65c4062d93c88927eb.jpg 640w, /media/98f33d7ab787be379a02eaebe2337121fb69b4db072673370cbe45ed400d8bd2.jpg 1800w, /media/38e4b6716f3120c693272c308f9ec8e99e705cc632b78c2fdf15b92b6e5c5201.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/ornot\" target=\"_blank\">Ornot</a> uses Polartec Alpha in a few of their pieces, and <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/ornot-shoulder-season-kit-review-like-an-onion\" target=\"_blank\">we’ve become big fans of the material</a>. Now, Polartec has a new Alpha Wool Fabric that combines wool’s natural properties with the high-tech performance of the original synthetic Alpha. You can have your cake and eat it too. Ornot is one of the few companies that has been granted early access to the material, so this is quite exciting news if fabrics and textures are your jam. Read below for all the details.</em></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/359cdce14608484595dd7358ad38a2d7acf45b336f26b0a1bc7295b31eb3b109.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/314325a694d6828b79f788e53ecf67178f864227cd7c9bb397480310099ebf82.jpg 800w, /media/d6c5a52d16bb12d974216509403d266b4d4ee35588cccc952030aaabffca91bc.jpg 1600w, /media/359cdce14608484595dd7358ad38a2d7acf45b336f26b0a1bc7295b31eb3b109.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/87eb12403b4974e9b2c68ead9950784e34f6263edb914c55e513c60f5b25302c.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/62061083cc495b10e09215e72ecc4a7150cd47d1a4f9bd66d9575a179918f7ef.jpg 800w, /media/b32a1e627e87d6a62c0553db54d7c00a4ca5497457d3355fddcd4806006cd97a.jpg 1600w, /media/87eb12403b4974e9b2c68ead9950784e34f6263edb914c55e513c60f5b25302c.jpg\" /></p>\n<h3>Ornot Wool Pullover Quick Hits:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>54% Poly, 6% Nylon, 40% Wool</li>\n<li>Available in Men’s and Women’s silhouettes</li>\n<li>Excellent warmth-to-weight ratio</li>\n<li>Abrasion-resistant fabric in high-wear areas</li>\n<li>Resists moisture and dries fast</li>\n<li>Loose, casual fit</li>\n<li>Sewn by hand in the USA</li>\n<li>Colors: Fog/Ochre</li>\n<li>MSRP: $198</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/9afb61a3ca5faa15c7c50b9640d6592093ad1ba005015c3a5552baa155d3a193.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/824be164e3d78c72befe2f5f6e15aa5a4e9c779b0888e7fae98e09e7bcf2a8b6.jpg 800w, /media/9afb61a3ca5faa15c7c50b9640d6592093ad1ba005015c3a5552baa155d3a193.jpg 1600w, /media/fb038c4dd2f70e0b0d71bade8170a1c8ddda260531d1ed6255bc811ce0369012.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/b6995587e589635744f7543d1029b81aac44d83fcd6523df0fa88ba8114cb0b2.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/19dbfd64369e0d3bf77bd0bacd1ff4dac3293877d0d4300c98c187c07b3bfa4f.jpg 800w, /media/b6995587e589635744f7543d1029b81aac44d83fcd6523df0fa88ba8114cb0b2.jpg 1600w, /media/edc68fa1726434c5079f1a08892bd6697a9496487fe9ea061ca19a42c23a9f19.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/dcf18407883d6631de48c786d52fedd170ad35bafa413c43a6fca2e97177d4cf.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/4cd652a54bb0f7365339d986dc6f2f59903407c12ead9d831b408abd753b7c32.jpg 800w, /media/dcf18407883d6631de48c786d52fedd170ad35bafa413c43a6fca2e97177d4cf.jpg 1600w, /media/55851c01ed615c84ecb36d2b1b7a0821d4e3534f70923f3e45a2325b4f98eab0.jpg\" /></p>\n<h3>Alpha Wool</h3>\n<p>Alpha with Wool is a brand new development from Polartec®. Made in the USA, this pullover takes the proven performance of Polartec® Alpha™ in a new direction, blending merino wool fibers into the lofted construction. Wool adds natural temperature regulation and moisture management, and makes this pullover so soft you’ll never want to take it off (ask us how we know). Purpose-built for stop-and-go efforts, like bike riding, where you need to dump heat quickly, the Alpha Wool Pullover merges the thermoregulation properties of Wool with the lightweight performance of Alpha™ Direct.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/c52bc57d147f4c603299da70be2ba8ed42a04630b3ef9dd85aba31563ee66260.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/ce40556947124ee10d3f7a0ef8c7d497e3dbf6f694beb19d7816da78578e3610.jpg 800w, /media/c52bc57d147f4c603299da70be2ba8ed42a04630b3ef9dd85aba31563ee66260.jpg 1600w, /media/65e0bd0c2d64258bab32f19c3dbbdc01a79736049defd6f3aa0cbc93488dd852.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/94f59e5a4adf2ab248ce814031c2368787977fe18ee7089b1bf93612aaf65093.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/715a7556dabdc6454598dd1ba96f474a0cf7dc91bc509cd0ce6589311bcf8d75.jpg 800w, /media/94f59e5a4adf2ab248ce814031c2368787977fe18ee7089b1bf93612aaf65093.jpg 1600w, /media/42db7a2aed24d575b67971c16459a5bc8ece88801dab2315c75156ce31619539.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/92ab3f5da7d86751f11a1ad6f863d4ba4384319a27160a3a03051a6240779ba1.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/19709f451fe73134217a58562ebb1180e4452938bcff96a9e4057a0d8c891a3d.jpg 800w, /media/92ab3f5da7d86751f11a1ad6f863d4ba4384319a27160a3a03051a6240779ba1.jpg 1600w, /media/71e41da1e3fe91e19ddb022e693080653b4fe888a1ff6b559acf1a0cdb808d84.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Originally adopted by thru-hikers, Alpha™ Direct is so lightweight it feels almost magical. This next-gen version, made with Polartec Alpha™ with Wool, advances its properties for wear on your bike, Ornot.</p>\n<p>See the Alpha Wool Pullover at Ornot, available in <a href=\"https://alnk.to/9TdNars\" target=\"_blank\">Men’s</a> and <a href=\"https://www.ornotbike.com/products/womens-alpha-wool-pullover-ochre\" target=\"_blank\">Women’s</a> cuts.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/ornot-alpha-wool-pullover\">Ornot Alpha Wool Pullover</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"Paul Kalifatidi","comments":"https://theradavist.com/ornot-alpha-wool-pullover#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"a6bd6e21c35143f98376d4fb34fd57a7df42d245f41ae5ec7abafd8c23803c8d","category":"Cycling"}